{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The form that I show you.</b> By the vision of the eye, for Ezekiel's visions were in a prophetic dream. And he added the demonstrative heh and said המשכן, after he had mentioned מקדש — an addition, with vav:" "<b>And so shall you make.</b> For the purpose of the implements, for at first <i>they shall make Me a sanctuary</i>:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "Resolved ה\"א הדעת as the grammatical term 'demonstrative heh' (heh haydi'ah), the definite article; Ibn Ezra's point is that the definite form המשכן is used where the bare noun מקדש appeared just before."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:15.288869276Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}